            <ArticleTitle>A personal view of the classification and definition of drug dependence headache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>68-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A review of the literature indicates that drug-induced headache exists. The criteria of the International Headache Society proposed for the diagnosis of &quot;headache induced by chronic substance use or exposure&quot;, however, need to be modified in order to identify all patients with this headache form.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
